    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d889">

                <pb facs="1071" n="975" xml:id="pg975"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Moore to Sir
                            Julian Pauncefote.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-05-04"><hi rendition="#italic">May 4,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 998.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note of the 3d instant apprising me that H. M. S. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Talbot</hi> has been ordered to Havana, and H. M. S. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Alert</hi> to Santiago de Cuba, for the purpose of
                    giving any necessary advice or assistance to the British consular officers, and
                    to inform you that this information has been communicated to the Secretary of
                    the Navy.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. B. Moore</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting Secretary</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
